name: feedback-to-changes
description: Turn meeting notes, review comments, emails or client feedback into logged feedback rows and individually approvable proposed changes, without applying anything unapproved. Use when feedback arrives, after a review or client meeting, when someone pastes comments or a notes link, or says "process this feedback" or "what did they ask for".
